        <mxCell id="n3" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#333333;fontStyle=2;whiteSpace=wrap;" value="One ledger table carries all seven kinds (D1), so there is one write path rather than seven. &quot;Is this spending?&quot; is then to_account_id IS NULL &#8212; a property of the data rather than a rule every future query has to remember (FR-8, FR-9). Legal values for every enum: docs/enums.md" vertex="1">
